{"game": "zombie-girl", "language": "english", "appid": 2618840, "month": "2023-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1698796800, "end_date": 1701388799, "month_true_total": 7, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-09-10 17:02:57 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "152138133", "author": {"steamid": "76561199166240503", "personaname": "Nik", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199166240503/", "num_games_owned": 190, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 683, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 553, "last_played": 1723539134, "avatar": "e37bf1f0b04a0b3d59501a42ca8cfe2e616aed22"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game \nThe dev is always updating it either fixing bugs or adding whole new content .\n\nI'm not complaining but i still have a bug where the character is nude even after removing the workshop mod & selecting an outfit so it's still not great but it is certainly getting there", "timestamp_created": 1701038742, "timestamp_updated": 1701038742, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1697180878", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "150867673", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083920589", "personaname": "нєя¢υℓєѕ (Mercy me!)", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mercykung/", "num_games_owned": 184, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 118, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 44, "last_played": 1703211301, "avatar": "4290f7c16da72a80387c7d44a72125a00ef2803e"}, "language": "english", "review": "อาฮ๊าาาาาาาาาา", "timestamp_created": 1700633148, "timestamp_updated": 1700633148, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.451081365346908569", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1697180878", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "150454565", "author": {"steamid": "76561198375448622", "personaname": "Tony186", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tony186/", "num_games_owned": 202, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 194, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 37, "last_played": 1704415541, "avatar": "0f18411149a060051bdafef053969f859dc73196"}, "language": "english", "review": "I actually like it. there are so many \"complex\" games out there these days, some good old simple fun that can also make you hard is just what I needed, here's hope for more updates and customizations", "timestamp_created": 1700428500, "timestamp_updated": 1700428500, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1697180878", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149945250", "author": {"steamid": "76561198112819846", "personaname": "Keeper Artemus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198112819846/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 544, "playtime_forever": 79, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 79, "last_played": 1699720437, "avatar": "d9c5cc998ad3223bf86db4dedac1bd9e4e95d29a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't be fooled by the screenshots and gameplay video like I was. This is a HIGHLY buggy cheap janky experience made by a single developer. All in-game audio is in Chinese or Japanese and there is no direction where to go or what to do. Gameplay consists of shooting zombies and picking up keys and that's basically it. There are only five levels and level design is bad where everything is laid out in confusing mazes with many areas having no purpose at all, like everything seems procedurally generated. There are also numerous bugs such as being shot at from off-screen for seemingly no reason, your mini-skirt glitching to where you are only wearing panties, and losing control of your character completely. You also cannot remap the WASD movement keys, you can't crouch, and you cannot manually save during a level to a place where you can return to. All zombies are also bullet sponges taking numerous shots to bring down and zombie sounds are also pretty bad. This game also caused my pc fans to race with high gpu temps. It even locked up my pc at one point to where I had to restart. I would seriously stay far away from this one.", "timestamp_created": 1699721732, "timestamp_updated": 1699722557, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 16, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.580738604068756104", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1697180878", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149599045", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162911566", "personaname": "NORA Love 🎀", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nore2005/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 335, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 99, "last_played": 1735051965, "avatar": "877fceb5742c56b52af51e58b5bc7ebad67b2e9b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very cute and nice game i love it and it need more content, the combat system very nice", "timestamp_created": 1699202430, "timestamp_updated": 1699202430, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.41421055793762207", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1697180878", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149473095", "author": {"steamid": "76561199123027956", "personaname": "AGriff", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199123027956/", "num_games_owned": 330, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 552, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 392, "last_played": 1714755961, "avatar": "4198f28e724b3996fb3893c7b0afc032ec18486a"}, "language": "english", "review": "An interesting game with randomly generated levels but each with a theme.\nAnd certain enemies such as only human enemies or with zombies/monsters and a boss at the end on mission 5.\nThe aiming can be a little too sensitive but getting kills only tale 1-2 shots with headshots.\nHealth is split with armour that goes down in 2-3 shots and health is much more durable but only recovers  with health kits, ammo is generous on anything below nightmare and with grinding for the best weapons can make nightmare much more manageable.\nIs it worth £6 yes if you like cheap indie games with random generation and some customisation then ye give it a look.", "timestamp_created": 1699048084, "timestamp_updated": 1699048084, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.55522608757019043", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1697180878", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149422734", "author": {"steamid": "76561198427904112", "personaname": "Torchic73", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198427904112/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 139, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 139, "last_played": 1698793431, "avatar": "cc208cf00ffff4cb5260a9a3377f038a16d1f857"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game play is okay, but the story 